&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:12.8pt;padding-right:4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-8.3pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;①当社提供のクラウドサービス移行によるエネルギー消費量削減&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
