  <jpigp_cor:NotesEarningsPerShareConsolidatedFinancialStatementsIFRSTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;32．１株当たり当期利益&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(1) 基本的１株当たり当期利益及び希薄化後1株当たり当期利益&lt;/h4&gt;
